<title>USA: Bank Austria issues $700 mln yankee 144A debt.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria issues $700 mln yankee 144A debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following yankee 144A private placement debt offering from Bank Austria was priced on Thursday via lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK AUSTRIA</p>
<p>AMT $700 MLN	 COUPON  7.25	MATURITY 02/15/17</p>
<p>TYPE YANKEE 144A   ISS PRICE 99.81   FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA1   YIELD  7.268	PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA	 SPREAD 50 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1675</p>
</text>
